OL,4,G0400FOwain Wyn Evans
OL,5,     GIt's Early Breakfast with Owain
OL,6,     GWyn Evans, featuring Step Back in
OL,7,     GTime! We want to know about the
OL,8,     Gsounds you love and loath! PLUS
OL,9,     GAirdrum Anthems this week has
OL,10,     Ggone 'School Disco'.
